OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785242915
OL,3,CMajor earthquake strikes southern Japan
OL,5,FA magnitude 7.1 earthquake struck
OL,6,FJapan's southern main island of Kyushu
OL,7,Fon Tuesday afternoon, causing damage
OL,8,Fand injuries, officials said.
OL,10,FA tsunami advisory was issued
OL,11,Ffollowing the quake but was lifted
OL,12,Fwithin two hours, according to the
OL,13,FJapan Meteorological Agency.
OL,15,FThe advisory covered the Ariake and
OL,16,FYatsushiro seas off the western coasts
OL,17,Fof Kumamoto, Nagasaki, Fukuoka and
OL,18,FSaga prefectures, about 900 kilometres
OL,19,F(560 miles) southwest of Tokyo.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
