OL,3,CMajor earthquake strikes southern Japan
OL,5,FSeveral people were trapped inside a
OL,6,Fshopping mall that partially collapsed
OL,7,Fin an explosion after the quake shook
OL,8,Fthe Japanese city of Kumamoto,
OL,9,Faccording to Japan's public
OL,10,Fbroadcaster NHK.
OL,12,FIt is unclear how many people were
OL,13,Ftrapped inside when the second floor
OL,14,Fof the building collapsed, NHK
OL,15,Freported, citing fire officials. About
OL,16,F50 people were injured in the blast,
OL,17,FNHK reported.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
