OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785242915
OL,3,CMajor earthquake strikes southern Japan
OL,5,FKyodo News agency reported that a
OL,6,Fhospital in Yatsushiro city treated
OL,7,Faround 40 people injured in the quake.
OL,9,FA train was derailed at Yatsushiro
OL,10,FStation, falling onto its side, while
OL,11,Fstone walls at Kumamoto Castle were
OL,12,Fdamaged, Kyodo reported.
OL,14,FJapan's Fire and Disaster Management
OL,15,FAgency said there were no reports of
OL,16,Fdamage to major public facilities or
OL,17,Finfrastructure, although authorities
OL,18,Fwere still assessing the full extent
OL,19,Fof the impact.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
