OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785242915
OL,3,CMajor earthquake strikes southern Japan
OL,5,FLocal fire departments received
OL,6,Fnumerous emergency calls reporting
OL,7,Ffires and damage to homes.
OL,9,F"We are putting people's lives as the
OL,10,Ftop priority," Takaichi said, urging
OL,11,Fresidents in the strongly shaken areas
OL,12,Fto use caution in light of possible
OL,13,Faftershocks.
OL,15,FShinji Kiyomoto, a planning officer
OL,16,Fwith the Japan Meteorological Agency's
OL,17,FEarthquake and Tsunami Countermeasures
OL,18,Fdivision, said the shallow earthquake
OL,19,Fhad triggered active seismic activity
OL,20,Fin the area.
