OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785242915
OL,3,CMajor earthquake strikes southern Japan
OL,5,FSpeaking at a news conference, he
OL,6,Furged residents to remain especially
OL,7,Fcautious over the next two to three
OL,8,Fdays.
OL,10,FHowever, he said no tsunami had been
OL,11,Fobserved following the inland
OL,12,Fearthquake.
OL,14,FJapan's Nuclear Regulation Authority
OL,15,Fsaid no abnormalities had been
OL,16,Fdetected at three nearby nuclear power
OL,17,Fplants.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
