OL,3,CMajor earthquake strikes southern Japan
OL,5,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,6,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,7,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,8,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,10,FShinkansen bullet trains and local
OL,11,Fservices across Kyushu were suspended
OL,12,Fwhile safety checks were carried out.
OL,14,FThe runway at Aso Kumamoto Airport was
OL,15,Falso closed, with a notice on the
OL,16,Fairport's website saying there was "no
OL,17,Fprospect of resuming operations".
OL,19,FThe Japanese Defence Ministry said it
OL,20,Fhad dispatched aircraft to the area to
OL,21,Fassess the situation.
