OL,3,CMajor earthquake strikes southern Japan
OL,5,FKumamoto was devastated by a deadly
OL,6,Fearthquake in 2016, which killed more
OL,7,Fthan 50 people, injured around 1,800
OL,8,Fand damaged or destroyed tens of
OL,9,Fthousands of homes.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/8
